-- UIC voluntary motor vehicle insurance rules, Part 1, Part I (definitions) and Part II
-- (general provisions): Articles 1, 2, 3, 6, 7, 8 and 9, and the opening paragraph of
-- Part II. Articles 4 and 5 (the parties' rights and duties) are in
-- uic-autojoy-p1-duties.l4. Part 2 of the document applies this Part II to its own cover,
-- except Article 8 (src:552).
